{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>If you say: How shall I dispossess them? Do not fear them.</b> When you say: How shall I dispossess them, given that they are more numerous than I — do not say this out of fear of them, but rather out of recognizing that this would have been impossible were it not for HaShem who was with you. And this is because <b>you shall well remember what HaShem your Elohim did to Pharaoh and to all Egypt</b>, who were more numerous and mightier than you, yet He delivered them into your hand and you destroyed their very name."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:20:49.681336380Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}